// Two origins, two ripples, one merged shape.
name Two Springs
rule B1/S012345678
steps 3
hint Two beginnings. Where the ripples met, the shape tells you where they started.
tip Each ripple alone is the shape from the first level. Find two such centres.
intro Two beginnings, one ending. Whatever lived here met in the middle and became a single thing.
outro Two seeds, one shape. Nothing that meets stays separate.
